sxml-qt4 - the W3C QT4 test-suite driver of sxml (a developer tool)

Usage: sxml-qt4 [--version] COMMAND [ARGUMENT...]

Commands:
  help  Show help for the program or for one command
  list  List test cases with their environments and applicability
  run   Run test cases and check their assertions

Options:
  -h, --help     Show this help and exit
      --version  Print the version and exit

Run 'sxml-qt4 help COMMAND' for help on one command.
Report bugs at https://github.com/dhamidi/sxml/issues
